<https://example.invalid/card/card/allLF> dcterms:identifier "swh:1:cnt:533389bb1b03609a90e6a33989a45d262c5a3e97" ;
    dcterms:title "allLF" ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.4" ;
    card:method """1. no temporal aggregation - 10-day centered moving average (VC10)
2. annual aggregation [month of maximum monthly flows] - minimum of VC10 (VCN10)
3. no temporal aggregation - maximum of VCN10, taken as the threshold (upLim)
4. annual aggregation [month of maximum monthly flows] - date of the first day of the longest period below upLim"""@en,
        """1. aucune agrégation temporelle - moyenne mobile centrée sur 10 jours (VC10)
2. agrégation annuelle [mois du maximum des débits mensuels] - minimum de VC10 (VCN10)
3. aucune agrégation temporelle - maximum de VCN10, pris comme seuil (upLim)
4. agrégation annuelle [mois du maximum des débits mensuels] - date du premier jour de la plus longue période sous upLim"""@fr ;
    card:path "flow/low-flows/series/allLF.yaml" .

<https://example.invalid/card/card/allLF_summer> dcterms:identifier "swh:1:cnt:907040d5245d7647be0f6f99442de2ee1da10388" ;
